# Update the live site

When a requested product change is finished, commit it, push `master`, and rebuild the live site. Do not leave the change only on this machine, and do not wait to be asked again.

- Commit only the files for that change. Never commit secrets.
- Push `origin` `master`.
- On the server, fast-forward `/opt/devcity/repo` and start `/tmp/finish-devcity.sh`. Do not start Docker with `dotenvx run`.
- Wait until the rebuild reports healthy, then say the live site is updated.
- Do not print the server address.
